---
---

<section class="section club" id="club">
  <div class="wrap club__inner">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">What this actually is</p>
      <h2>A club, not a race.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="club__body">
      <p>
        Run Baby Run is a free, open running club in Yerevan. There is no membership, no fee and no
        pace requirement. If you can walk out the door, you belong here.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every run has a front group and a back group, and nobody gets left behind. Some people come
        to chase a PB, some come because it beats scrolling at 10pm on a Tuesday. Both are the
        correct reason.
      </p>

      <ul class="facts">
        <li><strong>Free</strong> — always, for everyone</li>
        <li><strong>All paces</strong> — 4:30/km to 8:00/km, same start line</li>
        <li><strong>No sign-up</strong> — just turn up at the meeting point</li>
        <li><strong>Coffee after</strong> — the actual reason most of us come</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .club {
    background: var(--cream-deep);
    border-block: 2px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .club__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .club__body p {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    max-width: 56ch;
  }

  .facts {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .facts li {
    padding-left: 1.75rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .facts li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.65em;
    width: 0.75rem;
    height: 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--pink-deep);
  }

  .facts li:nth-child(even)::before {
    background: var(--green-deep);
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .club__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
